<title>FRANCE: French bond futures close lower, off day's lows.</title>
<headline>French bond futures close lower, off day's lows.</headline>
<text>
<p>1440 GMT - French bond futures closed weaker but off lows after a day of uneasy calm in debt markets. PIBOR finished lower and the franc fell below 3.42 per mark.</p>
<p>*Sept 10-yr future 123.10, off 0.20. Vol 121,491. Low 123.06</p>
<p>*2006 OAT yield 6.40 pct vs 6.38. Bund spread 5 bp vs 4</p>
<p>*Call money unch at 3-7/16 9/16 pct.Sept PIBOR 95.86, off 13 bp</p>
